WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:04.920
Most deaths are pretty self explanatory.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:11.270
But ever so occasionally a case comes along
that baffles even the savviest of detectives.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:15.170
These are the deaths that have no explanation
and no motive.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:20.080
We could just put these cases to bed and be
done with it, but where's the fun in that.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.449
There's something about a good murder mystery
case that makes people obsessed with finding

00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:25.880
out what actually happened.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:30.210
These are the five most unexplainable deaths
the world has ever known.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:32.730
Morgan Dana Harrington

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:39.110
First up is the mysterious disappearance of
Morgan Dana Harrington.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:44.370
She was a 20 year old student at Virginia
Tech University in Blacksburg, Virginia.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:51.240
On the 17th October 2009 Morgan attended a
Metallica concert in Virginia with a few friends.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:56.220
Whilst the support act were still performing,
Morgan went off on her own to use the bathroom,

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:59.970
since she didn't want to have to go after
Metallica had come on stage.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:05.370
After an unusually long time Morgan had still
not returned from the bathroom, Metallica

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.030
then came on stage and Morgan was still nowhere
to be seen.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:11.030
Her friends grew very worried.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:15.430
They rang Morgan and she picked up, she told
them she had not been allowed back into the

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:17.790
venue because of a "no re-entry" policy.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:21.640
But this was very strange because there were
toilets inside the venue.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:26.370
Yet Morgan had mysteriously gone outside,
for no good reason at all.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:29.920
Morgan told her friends not to worry and enjoy
the concert without her.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:32.890
She told them she would make her own way home.

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:37.380
Having trust in Morgan, her friends stayed
to enjoy the rest of the concert, unbeknown

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:41.060
to the fact that their friend was in grave
danger.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:45.530
Witnesses later said that they saw Morgan
outside the arena, on her own.

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:49.880
She was never spotted with anyone but her
friends throughout the entire night.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.710
Which leaves no explanation as to why she
exited the venue.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:59.229
Someone or something must had made her act
so strangely, but what was it?

00:01:59.229 --> 00:02:03.619
She was spotted by a witness hiking along
the side of the road later that night, still

00:02:03.619 --> 00:02:04.800
on her own.

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:09.619
She was not seen again for several weeks until
a farmer several miles from the venue of the

00:02:09.619 --> 00:02:14.950
Metallica concert, found the skeletal remains
of a young woman on the outskirts of his property.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.450
The remains were confirmed to be that of Morgan.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:23.290
There were signs that her death had been extremely
violent and she had been raped.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:27.349
There was extremely little evidence to go
on and what had led Morgan out of that arena

00:02:27.349 --> 00:02:33.400
that night and caused her to end up, dead,
at a farm several miles away, is still a mystery

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.520
to this day.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:35.520
Elisa Lam

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:41.311
In 2013 at the Cecil Hotel in the notorious
Skid Row neighbourhood in Los Angeles, one

00:02:41.311 --> 00:02:46.790
of the creepiest and most unexplainable deaths
of the 21st century, took place.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:53.330
In the days leading up to February 19th 2013,
hotel guests had been complaining of low water

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:57.810
pressure and oddly-coloured, foul smelling
and tasting water.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.130
Some even said the water coming out the taps
was black in colour.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:06.440
When the hotel staff went up to the roof to
investigate the cause, they were shocked to

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.620
find a body in the water tank.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:13.830
For a whole 19 days hundreds of guests at
the hotel, were bathing in, brushing their

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:19.260
teeth with and even drinking the water from
a tank on the rooftop that contained the decomposing

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.290
corpse of a college student.

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:26.200
The body turned out to be that of 21-year-old
Canadian student, Elisa Lam.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.739
Lam's death is shrouded in mystery.

00:03:28.739 --> 00:03:33.450
19 days before being found dead in the water
tank, Lam had gone missing whilst staying

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:34.950
at the hotel.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:39.830
On the day of her disappearance this disturbing
CCTV footage was released from inside the

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.489
hotel elevator.

00:03:41.489 --> 00:03:43.750
The video went viral on the internet.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:48.390
Lam appears to be hiding from someone, she
starts behaving erratically and at one point

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:53.710
she waves her arms around in an odd fashion,
before finally, disappearing.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.080
She was not seen again.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:04:00.970
Until 19 days later, when her body was found
inside the water tank on the roof.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:05.650
But apart from the fire escape, the roof is
only accessible via a set of stairs and locked

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:10.340
doors which only hotel employees have the
keys and passcodes to.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:14.010
The doors would set off an alarm if anyone
else tried to open them.

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:20.060
Yet Elisa Lam managed to somehow get through
the doors and onto the roof, without setting

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:21.760
the alarm off.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:26.919
Not only that, but she managed to get inside
one of the water tanks which is 2.4 metres

00:04:26.919 --> 00:04:32.919
tall and has no fixed access, the hotel staff
had to put a ladder up to check inside it.

00:04:32.919 --> 00:04:36.010
So how on Earth did Elisa Lam get in there?

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:41.820
Even more bizarrely, Lam also managed to somehow
close the extremely heavy lid on herself,

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:43.360
once inside the tank.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:47.970
Which would be extremely difficult, if not
impossible to do by herself.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:52.910
In fact the water tank was so tightly sealed
that authorities had to drill a hole into

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.220
it to get her body out.

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:59.720
This has led many people to believe that her
death was suspicious.

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:04.440
Which probably goes without saying, considering
it would be nearly impossible for Lam to end

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:06.660
up in that water tank all by herself.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:12.970
But with insufficient evidence her death was
marked as accidental and to this day nobody

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.370
truly knows what happened to Elisa Lam.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.370
Laetitia Toureaux

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:22.320
A "locked room mystery" is a unique sub-genre
of murder-mystery fiction, in which a murder

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:29.620
takes place in a seemingly locked room with
only one person inside, the victim.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:34.090
In these stories the murder seems to take
place under impossible circumstances.

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:40.650
It's extremely rare that these so called "locked
room mysteries" actual happen in real life.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:48.660
But one such case did happen, in 1937 in Paris,
to Laetitia Toureaux.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:53.660
At 6:27pm Laetitia Toureaux boarded a metro
train at the Porte de Charenton.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:58.380
When she got onto the train she was the only
person in the first-class carriage.

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:03.560
However, when the train pulled into the next
station, only one minute and twenty seconds

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:10.300
later at 6:28pm, Laetitia Toureaux slumped
forwards in her seat with a dagger in her

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:11.300
neck.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:18.650
She had somehow been stabbed in the neck and
killed, in seemingly impossible circumstances.

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:23.590
Witnesses at both stations swore that they
saw no one getting onto or leaving Toureaux's

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:26.520
train compartment at either stop.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:31.050
And witnesses in both adjacent compartments,
said that nobody had tried to enter the one

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:33.210
where Toureaux's body was found.

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.550
Police tried their best to solve the mystery.

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:41.770
But even Paris' best detective's had no idea
how Toureaux could have been stabbed in the

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:46.390
neck, in a time span of 1 minute, in a seemingly
empty train carriage.

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:51.210
World War II came and Toureaux's case was
forgotten about.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:55.120
Despite crime writers the world over giving
it their best.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:59.810
Nobody has since been able to solve this infamous,
real-life, locked room mystery.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:00.810
Ottavio Bottecchia

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:06.000
Italian man, Ottavio Bottecchia was one of
the most talented cyclists the world has ever

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.000
seen.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:12.180
In 1924 he became the first Italian to win
the world renowned Tour de France race.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:17.539
He was also the first person in history to
maintain the lead in the Tour de France all

00:07:17.539 --> 00:07:19.990
the way from start, to finish.

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:26.820
But the fame and glory was short-lived for
Bottecchia, because in June 1927, two years

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.569
after his second Tour de France victory.

00:07:29.569 --> 00:07:34.539
Bottecchia was found dead at the side of the
road in the village of Poenis, Italy, just

00:07:34.539 --> 00:07:36.860
a few miles from his home.

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:40.860
So what's so strange about this, it just sounds
like a bicycle crash.

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:46.440
Well Bottecchia's bike was a few metres from
his body, completely undamaged, with not a

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:49.240
single mark or scratch upon it.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:53.160
No skid marks were found on the road and there
were no signs that he had been forced from

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:56.539
the road or that he was in a collision at
all.

00:07:56.539 --> 00:08:02.210
Yet Bottecchia's body lay in the road with
his skull smashed in, a snapped collarbone

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.280
and numerous other broken bones.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:07.259
If that wasn't suspicious enough.

00:08:07.259 --> 00:08:12.360
The authorities came to the conclusion that
he had died of a sun stroke.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.360
Skull smashed in?

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:14.820
20 broken bones?

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:17.110
Looks like a bad case of sunstroke chief!

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:22.550
This ridiculous cause of death led many conspiracy
theorists to come to the conclusion that Bottecchia

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:25.090
was killed in a government assassination.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:30.990
For speaking out against authoritarian prime
minister Benito Mussolini and his murder was

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.940
covered up by the police.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:39.499
To this day we still have no further clue
as to what happened to legendary Italian cyclist

00:08:39.499 --> 00:08:40.819
Ottavio Bottecchia.

00:08:40.819 --> 00:08:43.249
Who Put Bella in the Witch Elm

00:08:43.249 --> 00:08:44.249
Who put Bella in the Witch Elm?

00:08:44.249 --> 00:08:46.889
That's was the question on everyone's lips
in 1943.

00:08:46.889 --> 00:08:53.600
It all started on 18th April 1943 when four
boys were poaching in the Hagley Woods near

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:56.540
Wychbury Hill in Stourbridge, England.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:59.800
The boys stumbled across a large Wych elm
tree.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:04.120
Believing it would be a good place to find
bird's nests, one of the boys climbed up the

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.120
tree.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:10.879
To his horror, when the boy looked down, inside
the tree's hollowed-out trunk he saw a human

00:09:10.879 --> 00:09:12.950
skull with hair and teeth.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:18.459
One of the boys reported it to the police
and when they investigated they found, almost,

00:09:18.459 --> 00:09:22.139
an entire skeleton inside the trunk of the
Wych elm.

00:09:22.139 --> 00:09:27.619
They also found a shoe, a gold wedding ring,
some fragments of clothing and a severed hand

00:09:27.619 --> 00:09:30.879
which was buried in the ground near the tree.

00:09:30.879 --> 00:09:35.600
After forensic examination it was determined
that the body was a female's and she had been

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:38.179
dead for at least 18 months.

00:09:38.179 --> 00:09:43.160
Taffeta was found in her mouth, suggesting
she died from asphyxiation.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.649
But then things got weirder.

00:09:45.649 --> 00:09:51.089
A year after the body was discovered strange
graffiti started to appear in random locations

00:09:51.089 --> 00:09:52.820
in the surrounding area.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:57.490
First on a wall in Upper Dean Street, Birmingham
and then in several more places over the next

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:04.050
few decades, until the last graffito was sprayed
onto the side of a 200 year-old obelisk known

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:08.100
as Wychbury Obelisk, in August 1999.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:13.809
The obelisk is located on Wychbury Hill, Hagley,
near where the body was found.

00:10:13.809 --> 00:10:19.170
Every single one of the graffiti said the
exact same thing "WHO PUT BELLA IN THE WITCH

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:20.170
ELM".

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:26.490
The identity of the killer and that of the
graffiti artist, were never discovered.

